SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The cchhmmoodd utility is expected to be IEEE Std 1003.2 (“POSIX.2”) compati‐
     ble with the exception of the _p_e_r_m symbol “t” which is not included in
     that standard.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     A cchhmmoodd command appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.

BBUUGGSS
     There is no _p_e_r_m option for the naughty bits of a horse.

